OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRain will
OL,6,Flinger in the southwest, reducing
OL,7,Fthrough the night. Spells of rain for
OL,8,FNorthern Ireland but with winds easing
OL,9,Fthere. A few showers for eastern
OL,10,FEngland and Scotland. Feeling cold
OL,11,Fwith a widespread frost and some icy
OL,12,Fstretches.
OL,13,
OL,14,CMonday:FWidespread frost to start,
OL,15,Fwith some fog lingering. Sunny and dry
OL,16,Ffor most but cloud will thicken in the
OL,17,Fwest, bringing further rain and strong
OL,18,Fwinds there later. Feeling cold.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
